      "message": "Do you need this to be multi-threaded right now?\nThe original job of the eventExecutor was to get off the event notification thread in the InternalDeviceListener.\nWith this change, multiple events will be processed in parallel which may be ok if we are careful about events related to the same device.\nI would only do this when we have a need it, say for scale",
